.TH batten-commit 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-commit \- The shape a commit must take here: what its subject may say
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten commit\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
The shape a commit must take here: what its subject may say
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-commit\-check(1)
Refuse a commit subject that does not follow the configured convention
.TP
batten\-commit\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
